{"seq":2,"slug":"types-contracts-fast-feedback","title":"类型契约与快速反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/verifiability-and-safe-change/types-contracts-fast-feedback","wordCount":1979,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型契约与快速反馈\">类型契约与快速反馈</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>测试守住「运行起来对不对」，而类型、契约与静态检查守住<strong>更早的一道关</strong>：代码还没运行、甚至 agent 还在编辑时，就把一大类错误当场挡下。它们共同构成一张「快速反馈网」——既收窄 agent 的选择空间（很多错根本写不出来），又在写错的瞬间精确报警。本篇给出这张网的 2025–2026 年生态证据：机器优先的契约层已成标准、工具链速度本身成了竞争目标、以及各层检查如何按成本阶梯排布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本章的核心是把验证前移到运行之前的那道关：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>即时护栏</strong>：类型在代码还没运行、甚至 agent 还在编辑时就把一大类错误当场挡下，且反馈精确到文件、行号与期望/实际类型。</li>\n<li><strong>契约三职</strong>：前置条件、后置条件与不变量这份声明，对人是文档，对运行时是校验器，对 agent 是可枚举的合法操作空间——同一份声明的三个投影。</li>\n<li><strong>快速反馈网</strong>：各层独立拦截率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，错误穿透全部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>escape</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∏</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{escape}} = \\prod (1-\\lambda_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">escape</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——每加一道廉价早期检查都在乘法上削减逃逸概率。</li>\n<li><strong>静态保证的两个性质</strong>：确定性（每次编译结果一致）与全路径覆盖（穷举分支，而测试只是抽样），代价是表达力有限。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"类型是-agent-的即时护栏\">类型是 agent 的即时护栏</h2><p>函数签名是 agent 能直接消费的接口文档：不必读实现就知道该传什么、会返回什么。而类型错误的反馈是<strong>即时且精确定位</strong>的——现代编辑器通过 Language Server Protocol 把诊断（出错文件、行号、期望类型与实际类型）主动推送到编辑现场（<a href=\"https://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/specifications/lsp/3.17/specification/\">LSP 3.17 Specification</a>）。对靠循环迭代的 agent 来说，这意味着错误在「写出来的同一秒」就被指认，修复路径最短。</p>\n<p>强类型还让大改动变得可收敛：改一处签名，所有受影响的调用点同时编译报错，agent 顺着报错把改动传播完整而不漏。代价是编译耗时进入了关键路径——于是工具链速度在 agent 时代升格为一等工程目标。微软于 2025-03-11 宣布将 TypeScript 编译器与工具集移植到原生实现，目标 <strong>10 倍性能提升</strong>（<a href=\"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/typescript/typescript-native-port/\">A 10x Faster TypeScript</a>）：当验证发生在每一轮循环里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>verify</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{verify}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">verify</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的数量级改进直接转化为迭代吞吐。</p>\n<p>同样的逻辑正在从类型系统扩展到整个仓库界面。AGENTS.md 规范支持嵌套：monorepo 可在每个子项目放一份，「agent 自动读取目录树中最近的那份，最近者优先」；OpenAI 主仓库在撰写时维护了 88 个 AGENTS.md 文件。这一格式由 OpenAI Codex、Amp、Google Jules、Cursor、Factory 等协作发起，现由 Linux 基金会旗下 Agentic AI Foundation 托管（<a href=\"https://agents.md/\">agents.md</a>）。llms.txt v2 把同构思想搬到站点层：网站根路径放一份 markdown 向导，页面在同 URL 提供 <code>.md</code> 干净版本；Chrome Lighthouse 已把 llms.txt 纳入 agentic browsing 检查项，OpenAI、Anthropic、Gemini 都为自己的开发者文档发布了它（<a href=\"https://llmstxt.org/\">The /llms.txt file, v2</a>）。类型签名、AGENTS.md、llms.txt 是同一个原则在不同尺度的实例：<strong>把约束写成机器可直接解析的形态</strong>。这条原则的一般论证（隐式假设的正确率连乘衰减）见<a href=\"../legibility-and-navigation/explicit-over-implicit\">显式胜于隐式</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反馈层级</th>\n<th>典型手段</th>\n<th>时延</th>\n<th>单错修复成本</th>\n<th>对 agent 循环的含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编辑期</td>\n<td>LSP 诊断、IDE 红线</td>\n<td>毫秒~秒</td>\n<td>近乎零</td>\n<td>错误写出来即被指认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译期</td>\n<td>strict 类型检查</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>覆盖全部路径的确定性检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边界校验</td>\n<td>schema 校验、断言</td>\n<td>运行瞬间</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>误用当场失败并指认字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试期</td>\n<td>行为测试</td>\n<td>秒~分钟</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>判定业务语义是否正确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线上</td>\n<td>监控与告警</td>\n<td>分钟~小时</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>代价最高层，应尽量前移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中「测试期」一层的完整方法论——什么样的测试对 agent 才算硬约束——见<a href=\"tests-as-agent-guardrails\">测试作为 Agent 的护栏</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"契约让边界明确\">契约让边界明确</h2><p>比类型更广义的契约，指前置条件、后置条件与不变量——这一思路源自 Bertrand Meyer 的 Design by contract：模块对外声明「调用前须满足什么、返回后保证什么、整个生命周期恒成立什么」（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Design_by_contract\">Design by contract</a>）。落到工程上，JSON Schema 已成为描述数据结构与工具输入的主流规范（<a href=\"https://json-schema.org/specification\">JSON Schema Specification</a>），MCP 服务端正是以 schema 声明每个工具的边界。</p>\n<p>契约的结构化程度直接影响 agent 的开销。Anthropic 的分析显示，把 MCP 工具定义从上下文窗口搬进代码执行环境、改为程序化调用后，上下文开销最高可降 <strong>98.7%</strong>——连接数千个工具的 agent 不必再先吞下数十万 token 的工具说明（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/code-execution-with-mcp\">Code execution with MCP</a>）。这印证了一个反直觉的结论：契约越结构化、越靠近调用点，agent 需要随身携带的自然语言说明就越少。契约因此一职三能：对人是文档，对运行时是校验器，对 agent 是可枚举的合法操作空间——三者是同一份声明的三个投影，而非三份重复劳动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    E[&quot;编辑期&lt;br/&gt;LSP 诊断&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;编译期&lt;br/&gt;strict 检查&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; V[&quot;边界&lt;br/&gt;schema 校验 加断言&quot;]&#10;    V --&gt; T[&quot;测试期&lt;br/&gt;行为断言&quot;]&#10;    T --&gt; P[&quot;线上&lt;br/&gt;监控告警&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    E[\"编辑期&lt;br/&gt;LSP 诊断\"] --&gt; C[\"编译期&lt;br/&gt;strict 检查\"]\n    C --&gt; V[\"边界&lt;br/&gt;schema 校验 加断言\"]\n    V --&gt; T[\"测试期&lt;br/&gt;行为断言\"]\n    T --&gt; P[\"线上&lt;br/&gt;监控告警\"]</pre><h2 id=\"快速反馈是-agent-的命脉\">快速反馈是 agent 的命脉</h2><p>各层防线不必完美，只需叠加。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 层独立拦截率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则一个错误在被发现前穿透全部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层的概率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>escape</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>catch</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>escape</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{escape}} = \\prod_{i=1}^{k} (1-\\lambda_i), \\qquad P_{\\text{catch}} = 1 - P_{\\text{escape}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">escape</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">catch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">escape</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每加一道廉价的早期检查，都在乘法上削减逃逸概率——这是「纵深防御」在 agent 场景的代数含义。反过来，若只有线上监控一道防线，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 再高也架不住修复成本位于阶梯顶端。</p>\n<p>静态保证还有两个运行时检验不具备的性质：<strong>确定性</strong>（每次编译结果一致，不像某次运行可能恰好没触发坏路径）与<strong>全路径覆盖</strong>（类型检查穷举所有分支，而测试只是抽样）。权衡在于表达力：静态系统能表达的约束有限，超出部分必须交给边界校验与测试——所以分层不是历史包袱，而是表达能力与时延之间的最优折中。最后一个常被忽视的条件：反馈必须在 agent 读得到的地方。退出码非零、诊断输出带结构化定位、失败摘要落在标准输出——再快的反馈，若 agent 取不到或读不懂，等于不存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li>本地与 CI 共用同一个 typecheck + lint 入口，保证 agent 在本地看到的红绿与合并门禁完全一致，杜绝「本地绿 CI 红」的双标信号。</li>\n<li>开满严格模式（如 TS <code>strict</code>），把 <code>any</code> 收敛到系统边界：外部数据在入口处解析并窄化为精确类型，内部传递不再裸奔。</li>\n<li>工具与 schema 校验的报错信息带上字段路径与期望结构摘要，让一次失败就足以定位修正。</li>\n<li>预算优先投给验证速度：先用原生编译器或增量模式把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>verify</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{verify}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">verify</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压进秒级，再考虑增加门禁数量——顺序颠倒会让 agent 在慢循环里烧掉预算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>类型、契约、静态检查构成测试之前的即时护栏，其价值由两个量决定：各层拦截率的乘积效应与单次验证的时延。2025 年后的生态趋势是把约束进一步机器化——从类型签名到 AGENTS.md 与 llms.txt，再到以 schema 定界的 MCP 工具；与之配套的是工具链速度竞赛（如 TypeScript 原生移植的 10 倍目标）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型契约与快速反馈","id":"类型契约与快速反馈"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"类型是 agent 的即时护栏","id":"类型是-agent-的即时护栏"},{"level":2,"text":"契约让边界明确","id":"契约让边界明确"},{"level":2,"text":"快速反馈是 agent 的命脉","id":"快速反馈是-agent-的命脉"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"测试作为 Agent 的护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/verifiability-and-safe-change/tests-as-agent-guardrails"},"next":{"title":"小步可逆的变更","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/verifiability-and-safe-change/small-reversible-changes"}}